[01:03.39] Who are these fools?
[01:03.39] 这些傻瓜是谁
[01:05.67] How could they treat us this way?
[01:05.67] 他们怎么能这样对待我们
[01:13.01] Where are these words?
[01:13.01] 这些话语在哪里
[01:15.93] How could we possibly obey?
[01:15.93] 我们怎么可能服从

